/* Novedades por versión: clave = versión. */
"1.2.1" = "• If the signature server limits downloads, ClamMac now explains it and retries by itself.\n• Signatures are downloaded from the abDatabase mirror, with fallback to the official ClamAV server: more reliable installs in clinics with several Macs.\n• New “Copy diagnostics” button to send to support.\n• New languages: Japanese and Arabic.";
"1.2.2" = "• Fixed: if the official ClamAV server had previously blocked the network, ClamMac would not download signatures even from the mirror.\n• If a download leaves no signatures, Status no longer says “up to date”: it explains the problem.";
"1.2.3" = "• Fixed the bug that prevented signatures from downloading on most Macs (“v? · ?” appeared after installing).\n• ClamMac no longer stops when checking the freshly downloaded database.";
